#: app_report_exporter.py:214
msgid ""
"\n"
"    This report provides a comprehensive overview of the bitumen adhesion"
" test protocol,\n"
"    with all relevant information according to the CSN 73 6161 standard.\n"
"    The adhesion test was performed on "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"    Tento report poskytuje přehled o zkoušce přilnavosti asfaltové směsi,"
