msgid ""
"\n"
"    Both the visual expert assesment and the AI-based quantitative "
"analysis are included in this report.\n"
"    If this two contradict each other, the visual expert assesment is "
"considered the final result, however,\n"
"    the AI-based visualization is included for reference. \n"
"    "
